, body composition, sleep, SpO₂, respiratory rate, mood, and cycle tracking — charted with trends, moving averages, and clinical reference ranges (ESH…","Clinical signals, opt-in and additive. Validated self-checks for mental wellbeing and sleep (WHO-5, PHQ-9, GAD-7, Sleep Condition Indicator — official questionnaire wording, calm crisis-resource handling), grip…","Records, structured. Allergies and family history as structured records that flow into the doctor report (reactions and notes are encrypted, the substance and condition names are not), plus lab values you key in or scan…","A document vault for the paper trail. An opt-in module stores every letter, report, and scan encrypted at rest — PDFs and photos preview inline, Office and text files stay download-only, and nothing user-uploaded can…","Context that explains the numbers. An opt-in environmental module folds weather, daylight, and temperature in as influence signals (winter darkness against mood, heat against blood pressure) using a home location you…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MBombeck/HealthLog/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ccbceb4b128adbb4eb5f2e95f9d0cf1feb25164c1c18a21b581c6b415536f5fd","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.412Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:43:44.584Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-hosted, privacy-first health tracking. Your vitals, your devices, your server.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MBombeck/HealthLog/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Try the live demo to see a working install — sign in with demo / demo123demo123.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MBombeck/HealthLog/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Passkey login, server-side sessions, strict CSP, and no third-party tracking anywhere.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MBombeck/HealthLog/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ccbceb4b128adbb4eb5f2e95f9d0cf1feb25164c1c18a21b581c6b415536f5